# W32, host a (k10, flag 20: the Fortress open): hosts Death Valley and walks stag0101 -> staggf01 -> staggf02 -> staggf04
# -> stag0205's plateau (point 1) and back to staggf04 along kExits' Fortress edges (campaign.cpp: stag0101 matz01 to point
# 1, staggf01 matz01 to 1, staggf02 matz02 to 2, staggf04 matz00 to stag0205 point 1, stag0205 matz00 to staggf04 point 1),
# each by the depart action with the exit's own target (the trial merge's explore bot fell in staggf02-04). The Fortress
# and the plateau are Death Valley's scope (decision 39, 19.30.2): the instance goes on, no area_escape.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
depart staggf01 1 until stage=staggf01,control
depart staggf02 1 until stage=staggf02,control
depart staggf04 2 until stage=staggf04,control
log a deep in the Fortress
depart stag0205 1 until stage=stag0205,control
log a on the plateau
depart staggf04 1 until stage=staggf04,control
log a back in the Fortress
idle until frames>=300
log a done
